00:37:49,565 --> 00:37:55,565
The Naked Gun is a 2025 American action comedy parody film directed by Akiva
Schaffer, who co-wrote the screenplay with Dan Gregor and Doug Mand.

11
00:41:36,521 --> 00:41:42,521
The fourth film in the Naked Gun franchise, it stars Liam Neeson in the main role, with Pamela
Anderson, Paul Walter Hauser, Kevin Durand, and Danny Huston in supporting roles.

12
00:45:23,478 --> 00:45:29,478
Its plot follows the son of Lt.

13
00:49:10,434 --> 00:49:16,434
Frank Drebin who must succeed in his father's footsteps
to prevent the closure of Police Squad.

14
00:52:57,391 --> 00:53:03,391
A fourth Naked Gun film was announced in 2009, as a direct-to-TV sequel starring Leslie Nielsen, with Alan Spencer being
attached to write; however, the project was cancelled due to Spencer's departure, and Nielsen died in November 2010.

15
00:56:44,347 --> 00:56:50,347
After several years of development, including being redeveloped as a reboot starring Ed Helms in 2013, it was announced in
January 2021 that Seth MacFarlane had been hired to develop the project, and he expressed interest in casting Neeson.

16
01:00:31,304 --> 01:00:37,304
Although MacFarlane was hired to direct, Schaffer replaced him after the
film was greenlit in October 2022, and Neeson was cast.

17
01:04:18,260 --> 01:04:24,260
Anderson was cast in April 2024, and further casting took place the
following month, when filming began in Atlanta, Georgia.

18
01:08:05,217 --> 01:08:11,217
Filming wrapped that June.

19
01:11:52,173 --> 01:11:58,173
The Naked Gun premiered at the SVA Theater in Manhattan on July 28, 2025, and was
released in the United States by Paramount Pictures on August 1, 2025.

20
01:15:39,130 --> 01:15:45,130
It received positive reviews from critics and grossed $102.1
million worldwide on a $42 million budget.

21
01:19:26,086 --> 01:19:32,086
The film explores themes of bounty hunter, loss of loved
one, kidnapping, revenge, loss of job.

22
01:23:13,043 --> 01:23:19,043
The tone is intense.
